{
  "headline": "Water is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 2.4 days on hand and the top alternate is American Regent, Inc. (VAI 2024-04-24)",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {"text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include water as of 2026-10-21.", "cites": ["D4"]},
    {"text": "Corvale East holds 8 vials of water 1 mL/mL, 10 mL with a daily use of 3.4, giving 2.4 days on hand.", "cites": ["D1"]},
    {"text": "Corvale General holds 46 vials at 4.3 per day for 10.6 days on hand, and Corvale Lakeside holds 7 vials at 0.7 per day for 9.7 days on hand.", "cites": ["D2", "D3"]},
    {"text": "The rule ranks buying from American Regent, Inc. as the first option; it is not on FDA's shortage list today and its plant last inspection was VAI on 2024-04-24.", "cites": ["D5"]},
    {"text": "The second option is B. Braun Medical Inc., also not on the shortage list.", "cites": ["D6"]},
    {"text": "The third option is Civica, Inc. supplied from Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., whose plant last inspection was NAI on 2026-05-13.", "cites": ["D7"]}
  ]
